                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/releases/tag/v15.1.4"&gt;v15.1.4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Security&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This release fixes two denial-of-service vulnerabilities. In both, deeply nested input could bypass &lt;code&gt;MaxDepth&lt;/code&gt; and exhaust the stack. The resulting &lt;code&gt;StackOverflowException&lt;/code&gt; can't be caught, so it ends the process. Please upgrade if your application maps untrusted, deeply nested data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/security/advisories/GHSA-6vhm-j9h7-f9gh"&gt;GHSA-6vhm-j9h7-f9gh&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;code&gt;MaxDepth&lt;/code&gt; wasn't enforced when mapping through constructor parameters, including positional records. Thanks to &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mcambria/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mcambria"&gt;@mcambria&lt;/a&gt; for the report.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/security/advisories/GHSA-gpwp-5797-mjff"&gt;GHSA-gpwp-5797-mjff&lt;/a&gt;: other recursion paths bypassed &lt;code&gt;MaxDepth&lt;/code&gt;: derived maps, &lt;code&gt;object&lt;/code&gt; and interface members, dictionary and dynamic sources, and recursive type converters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CVE IDs have been requested and will be added here once they're assigned.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Behavior changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recursion that &lt;code&gt;MaxDepth&lt;/code&gt; can't limit now throws a catchable &lt;code&gt;InsufficientExecutionStackException&lt;/code&gt; instead of crashing the process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Derived maps (&lt;code&gt;Include&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;IncludeBase&lt;/code&gt;) now inherit &lt;code&gt;MaxDepth&lt;/code&gt; and get the default limit of 64 for self-referential maps. If your polymorphic graphs legitimately go deeper, set &lt;code&gt;MaxDepth&lt;/code&gt; explicitly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constructor mapping now stops at the same depth as property mapping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Other fixes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;Context.Items are only available...&lt;/code&gt; exceptions with &lt;code&gt;MaxDepth&lt;/code&gt;, which depended on registration or warmup order (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5340823602" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4651" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4651/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4651"&gt;#4651&lt;/a&gt;, backported in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6126192868" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4676" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4676/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4676"&gt;#4676&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[15.x] Fail the release when the tag is not on its release branch by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jbogard/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jbogard"&gt;@jbogard&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6049028958" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4669" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4669/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4669"&gt;#4669&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[15.x] Emit the context check for the containing type map in CollectionMapper by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jbogard/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jbogard"&gt;@jbogard&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6126192868" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4676" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4676/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4676"&gt;#4676&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[15.x] Run unit tests on .NET Framework in CI by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jbogard/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jbogard"&gt;@jbogard&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6150180885" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4678" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4678/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4678"&gt;#4678&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/compare/v15.1.3...v15.1.4"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v15.1.3...v15.1.4&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/releases/tag/v16.3.0"&gt;v16.3.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Security&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This release fixes two denial-of-service vulnerabilities. In both, deeply nested input could bypass &lt;code&gt;MaxDepth&lt;/code&gt; and exhaust the stack. The resulting &lt;code&gt;StackOverflowException&lt;/code&gt; can't be caught, so it ends the process. Please upgrade if your application maps untrusted, deeply nested data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/security/advisories/GHSA-6vhm-j9h7-f9gh"&gt;GHSA-6vhm-j9h7-f9gh&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;code&gt;MaxDepth&lt;/code&gt; wasn't enforced when mapping through constructor parameters, including positional records. Thanks to &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mcambria/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mcambria"&gt;@mcambria&lt;/a&gt; for the report.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/security/advisories/GHSA-gpwp-5797-mjff"&gt;GHSA-gpwp-5797-mjff&lt;/a&gt;: other recursion paths bypassed &lt;code&gt;MaxDepth&lt;/code&gt;: derived maps, &lt;code&gt;object&lt;/code&gt; and interface members, dictionary and dynamic sources, and recursive type converters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CVE IDs have been requested and will be added here once they're assigned.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Behavior changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recursion that &lt;code&gt;MaxDepth&lt;/code&gt; can't limit now throws a catchable &lt;code&gt;InsufficientExecutionStackException&lt;/code&gt; instead of crashing the process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Derived maps (&lt;code&gt;Include&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;IncludeBase&lt;/code&gt;) now inherit &lt;code&gt;MaxDepth&lt;/code&gt; and get the default limit of 64 for self-referential maps. If your polymorphic graphs legitimately go deeper, set &lt;code&gt;MaxDepth&lt;/code&gt; explicitly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constructor mapping now stops at the same depth as property mapping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;Condition&lt;/code&gt; on &lt;code&gt;ForAllMembers&lt;/code&gt;, or any condition whose member parameter is &lt;code&gt;object&lt;/code&gt; or a base type, now receives the source member value instead of the value converted to the destination type, when those types differ. This matches the documented contract. A &lt;code&gt;null&lt;/code&gt; in a nullable source member is now seen as &lt;code&gt;null&lt;/code&gt; rather than &lt;code&gt;0&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;false&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5352547409" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4655" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4655/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4655"&gt;#4655&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Other highlights&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;Context.Items are only available...&lt;/code&gt; exceptions with &lt;code&gt;MaxDepth&lt;/code&gt;, which depended on registration or warmup order (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5340823602" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4651" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4651/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4651"&gt;#4651&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;License keys get a 30-day renewal grace period, which logs a warning instead of an error (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6045702465" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4667" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4667/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4667"&gt;#4667&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clearer license validation messages for malformed keys, client platforms and IdentityModel version mismatches (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6060660040" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4670" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4670/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4670"&gt;#4670&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whitespace is stripped from license keys (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5618859121" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4663" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4663/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4663"&gt;#4663&lt;/a&gt;), and license validation is isolated from the host app's &lt;code&gt;CryptoProviderFactory&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6081817421" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4674" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4674/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4674"&gt;#4674&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bump Testcontainers.MsSql to 4.14.0 to clear NU1903 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jbogard/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jbogard"&gt;@jbogard&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5341681579" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4652" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4652/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4652"&gt;#4652&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;docs: replace dead MyGet build link with CI feed link by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/JiuYue0820/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/JiuYue0820"&gt;@JiuYue0820&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5170481574" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4648" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4648/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4648"&gt;#4648&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Emit the context check for the containing type map in CollectionMapper (fixes &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5340821958" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4650" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4650/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4650"&gt;#4650&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jbogard/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jbogard"&gt;@jbogard&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5340823602" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4651" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4651/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4651"&gt;#4651&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pass the source member value to Condition by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jbogard/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jbogard"&gt;@jbogard&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5352547409" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4655" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4655/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4655"&gt;#4655&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
